<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>HTML5 Semantic Controls Samples</h1>

<table class="sampletable">

<tr><td class="samplenote">
A page region built from the semantic controls. Each control renders its HTML5 element,
shown here with a light border.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TMain Style="border:1px solid #bbb; padding:8px; display:block">
  <com:THeader Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; display:block">
    <strong>Site title</strong>
  </com:THeader>
  <com:TNav Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; margin-top:6px; display:block">
    <com:THyperLink Text="Home" NavigateUrl="#" /> |
    <com:THyperLink Text="About" NavigateUrl="#" />
  </com:TNav>
  <com:TArticle Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; margin-top:6px; display:block">
    <strong>An article</strong>
    <p>TArticle renders an &lt;article&gt; element around this content.</p>
    <com:TAside Style="border:1px dashed #ccc; padding:6px; display:block">
      An aside related to the article.
    </com:TAside>
  </com:TArticle>
  <com:TSection Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; margin-top:6px; display:block">
    <strong>A section</strong>
    <p>A thematic grouping of content.</p>
  </com:TSection>
  <com:TFooter Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; margin-top:6px; display:block">
    Copyright.
  </com:TFooter>
</com:TMain>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Highlighted text with <tt>TMark</tt>:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
The report found a match on the word <com:TMark>revenue</com:TMark> in the third paragraph.
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
The <tt>TagName</tt> property renders a different element. This <tt>TSection</tt> renders
an <tt>&lt;article&gt;</tt> element.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TSection TagName="article" Style="border:1px solid #bbb; padding:6px; display:block">
  Rendered with TagName="article".
</com:TSection>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Two navigation regions, each named with an <tt>aria-label</tt> so a screen reader tells
them apart. The labels are set in the page's code with the <tt>Attributes</tt> collection.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TNav ID="PrimaryNav" Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; display:block">
  Primary navigation.
</com:TNav>
<com:TNav ID="FooterNav" Style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; margin-top:6px; display:block">
  Footer navigation.
</com:TNav>
</td></tr>

</table>

</com:TContent>
